     "titulo": "Describing the problem and asking for a solution",
     "texto": [
      "Use the past tense to say when you bought the item: **Jeg kjøpte den på mandag** («I bought it on Monday»). Describe the current fault: **Laderen fungerer ikke** («The charger doesn't work»). To ask for a solution, ask **Kan jeg bytte den?** («Can I exchange it?») or **Hva kan vi gjøre?** («What can we do?»).",
      "Be specific: explain what you tried and show the receipt if you have it. There is no need to make claims about rights or deadlines without checking the applicable conditions."
